      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Users being able to make their own is something that VRChat already talked about on their 2025.2.3 Patch Note video: (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qY0Uvho2AOY) See 2:14\n\nAs Straz is saying, they would like it to happen, but not for now as it raises questions about the performance, moderation, how it interacts with other systems, etc. \n\nStill I hope it does one day happens ! (Maybe 2026 as they also hope in the Patch Note)",
