  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I think users being able to create their own inventory items would be a nice feature. You could have props, pets, and vehicles that would be compatible with any avatar, wouldn't drag down the performance rating of your avatar and be bound only to a specific one, and could be made public to share with others, or private if you want to keep them to yourself.",
